      "progress": { "current": 45, "total": 80 },
      "messages": [
        { "speaker": "aman", "text": "Bilkul sahi Raju! Aur ek aur famous confusion — 'used to' (past habit) VS 'be used to' (habituated/accustomed hona)." },
        { "speaker": "raju", "text": "Sir ye to naam bhi milta julta hai, ye kaise alag pehchane?" },
        { "speaker": "aman", "text": "'I used to live in Patna' = pehle rehta tha. Lekin 'I am used to living in Patna' = ab mujhe aadat ho gayi hai. Dhyan do — 'be used to' ke baad V-ing aata hai, V1 nahi!" },
        { "speaker": "raju", "text": "Ohh! 'am used to' ke baad 'ing', but sirf 'used to' ke baad plain verb — ⭐ ye toh super trap hai exam ka!" }
      ],
      "navigation": { "next": "card_46_quiz1", "button_text": "Next Card ➔" }
    },

    {
