      },
      "navigation": { "next": "card_59_since_for_rule", "button_text": "Start Next Module ➔" }
    },

    {
      "card_id": "card_59_since_for_rule",
      "card_slug": "card_59_since_for_rule",
      "type": "chat",
      "concept_id": "since_for_wish_if",
      "level": 8,
      "progress": { "current": 59, "total": 80 },
      "messages": [
        { "speaker": "aman", "text": "Ek baar phir pakka karte hain Since/For ka rule kyunki ye Present Perfect aur Past Perfect Continuous dono mein bahut aata hai. Since = FIXED POINT (since 2015, since Monday), For = DURATION (for 3 years, for a week)." },
        { "speaker": "raju", "text": "Sir agar 'since childhood' bole to point hai na?" },
        { "speaker": "aman", "text": "Bilkul sahi! 'Childhood' ek starting point hai. 'I have known him since childhood' sahi hai. Agar 'for' use karte — 'for childhood' — galat ban jaata." },
        { "speaker": "raju", "text": "Toh 'since' = kab se shuru hua, 'for' = kitni der se — clear ho gaya!" }
      ],
      "navigation": { "next": "card_60_wish_past", "button_text": "Next Card ➔" }
    },

    {
      "card_id": "card_60_wish_past",
      "card_slug": "card_60_wish_past",
      "type": "chat",
      "concept_id": "since_for_wish_if",
      "level": 8,
      "progress": { "current": 60, "total": 80 },
      "messages": [
        { "speaker": "aman", "text": "Ab 'Wish' seekhते hain — jab hum kisi cheez ki chahat/afsos dikhate hain. Present ki cheez ke liye 'wish + Simple Past': 'I wish I had a car' (abhi nahi hai)." },
        { "speaker": "raju", "text": "Aur agar past ki koi galti pe afsos ho, jaise 'kaash maine mehnat ki hoti'?" },
        { "speaker": "aman", "text": "Tab 'wish + Past Perfect' aayega — 'I wish I had studied harder' (past mein nahi kiya, ab pachhtava hai)." },
        { "speaker": "raju", "text": "⭐ Toh present regret = wish+Past Simple, past regret = wish+Past Perfect — same jaisa If-clause wala pattern lag raha hai!" }
      ],
      "navigation": { "next": "card_61_if_clause_type2_3", "button_text": "Next Card ➔" }
    },

    {
      "card_id": "card_61_if_clause_type2_3",
      "card_slug": "card_61_if_clause_type2_3",
      "type": "chat",
      "concept_id": "since_for_wish_if",
      "level": 8,
      "progress": { "current": 61, "total": 80 },
      "messages": [
        { "speaker": "aman", "text": "Bilkul sahi observation Raju! If-clause Type 2 (unreal present): If + Past Simple, would + V1 — 'If I had money, I would buy a car.'" },
        { "speaker": "raju", "text": "Aur Type 3 wala past ki hypothetical baat ke liye hoga?" },
        { "speaker": "aman", "text": "Haan! Type 3 (unreal past/regret): If + Past Perfect, would have + V3 — 'If I had studied, I would have passed.' Trap: 'would have' ki jagah 'would' likhna galat hai." },
        { "speaker": "raju", "text": "Toh 'If clause' mein 'would' NAHI aata, sirf main clause mein aata hai — 'if' wale part mein sirf Past/Past Perfect!" }
      ],
      "navigation": { "next": "card_62_reported_speech_backshift", "button_text": "Next Card ➔" }
    },

    {
      "card_id": "card_62_reported_speech_backshift",
      "card_slug": "card_62_reported_speech_backshift",
      "type": "chat",
      "concept_id": "since_for_wish_if",
      "level": 8,
      "progress": { "current": 62, "total": 80 },
      "messages": [
        { "speaker": "aman", "text": "Last concept — Reported Speech ka 'Backshift Rule'. Jab reporting verb Past mein ho (said, told), to andar ka tense EK STEP PEECHE chala jaata hai." },
        { "speaker": "raju", "text": "Matlab kaise sir?" },
        { "speaker": "aman", "text": "Present Simple → Past Simple, Present Continuous → Past Continuous, Simple Past → Past Perfect. 'He said, \"I go to school\"' → 'He said that he went to school.'" },
        { "speaker": "raju", "text": "Aur agar direct speech mein already Past hai, jaise 'I went'?" }
      ],
      "navigation": { "next": "card_63_quiz1", "button_text": "Next Card ➔" }
    },

    {
      "card_id": "card_63_quiz1",
      "card_slug": "card_63_quiz1",
      "type": "quiz",
      "concept_id": "since_for_wish_if",
      "level": 8,
      "progress": { "current": 63, "total": 80 },
      "quiz_payload": {
        "question": "'He said, \"I went to Delhi.\"' Iska sahi Reported Speech kya hoga?",
        "options": [
          { "id": "A", "text": "He said that he went to Delhi." },
          { "id": "B", "text": "He said that he had gone to Delhi." },
          { "id": "C", "text": "He said that he goes to Delhi." },
          { "id": "D", "text": "He said that he has gone to Delhi." }
        ],
        "correct_option_id": "B",
        "explanation": "Backshift rule mein Simple Past (went) → Past Perfect (had gone) ban jaata hai jab reporting verb Past mein ho."
      },
      "navigation": { "next": "card_64_quiz2", "button_text": "Check Answer & Continue ➔" }
    },

    {
      "card_id": "card_64_quiz2",
      "card_slug": "card_64_quiz2",
      "type": "quiz",
      "concept_id": "since_for_wish_if",
      "level": 8,
      "progress": { "current": 64, "total": 80 },
      "quiz_payload": {
        "question": "Error Detection: 'If he had worked hard (A)/ he would pass (B)/ the examination last year (C)/ No error (D)'",
        "options": [
          { "id": "A", "text": "Part A" },
          { "id": "B", "text": "Part B" },
          { "id": "C", "text": "Part C" },
          { "id": "D", "text": "No error" }
        ],
        "correct_option_id": "B",
        "explanation": "If-clause Type 3 mein main clause 'would have + V3' hota hai, sirf 'would pass' galat hai. Sahi: 'he would have passed'."
      },
      "navigation": { "next": "card_65_quiz3", "button_text": "Check Answer & Continue ➔" }
    },

    {
      "card_id": "card_65_quiz3",
      "card_slug": "card_65_quiz3",
      "type": "quiz",
      "concept_id": "since_for_wish_if",
      "level": 8,
      "progress": { "current": 65, "total": 80 },
      "quiz_payload": {
        "question": "'I wish I ___ him yesterday' (afsos, past mein mile nahi) — sahi form?",
        "options": [
          { "id": "A", "text": "meet" },
          { "id": "B", "text": "met" },
          { "id": "C", "text": "had met" },
          { "id": "D", "text": "have met" }
        ],
        "correct_option_id": "C",
        "explanation": "Past ke afsos ke liye 'wish + Past Perfect' aata hai — 'I wish I had met him yesterday.'"
      },
      "navigation": { "next": "card_66_milestone8", "button_text": "Check Answer & Continue ➔" }
    },

    {
      "card_id": "card_66_milestone8",
